  "bodyHash": "b596b5ac34969bc2",
  "content": "<h4><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">煩人村民重製版調整<br><br>本模組添加了大量內容，主要設計用於搭配由 MrFudgeMonkeyz 製作的 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-annoying-villagers-modpack-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《煩人村民重製版整合包》</a></span>，透過加入「煩人村民系列」中的多項內容來實現。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">本模組主要新增以下內容：<br><br>-X_Grave_X（擁有專屬武器與盔甲）<br><br>-可騎乘的牛<br><br>-Mr.Colder</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">-鍊金術士（擁有專屬武器）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">-紅衣殭屍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">-為平衡性而設定的金蘋果與附魔金蘋果冷卻時間</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">-災厄之王（擁有專屬武器與盔甲）<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">-實體 303（仍在測試階段）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">-芥末（仍在測試階段）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">由於本模組需要大量的模組依賴，因此不建議在 </span><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-annoying-villagers-modpack-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《煩人村民重製版整合包》</a></span> 之外使用</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">如果您仍希望在未使用該整合包的情況下下載此模組，您需要安裝以下模組：<br><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/annoying-villagers-herobrine-invasion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">煩人村民：Herobrine入侵</a><br><br><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥</a><br><br><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇蹟之武（WOM）</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-indestructible/files/7125700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥 - 不可摧毀</a><br><br></span>感謝 Pugilist Steve 和 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-mrfudgemonkeyz-annoying-villagers-server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">煩人村民伺服器資源包</a></span> 提供部分貼圖<br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
